<title>USA: API says will not issue petroleum data Tuesday.</title>
<headline>API says will not issue petroleum data Tuesday.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-03-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The American Petroleum Institute said that due to a computer problem its petroleum stocks and storage data for the week ended March 7 will not be issued on Tuesday.</p>
<p>An API spokeswoman was unable to confirm when the data would be released. A new release time would be announced early on Wednesday, she said.</p>
</text>
